  <h2>About this site</h2>
  <p>This site is a collection of technical articles. Most articles define the terms first, explain the idea with a diagram, walk through the steps or decisions, and end with the sources.</p>
  <p>The site also covers AI and agentic AI on Azure. Each article defines its terms before using them and links the Microsoft documentation it relies on. Examples use made-up organizations, never real company names.</p>
  <h2>Where to start</h2>
  <p><a href="/start-here/">Start here</a> explains how the site is organized. The <a href="/azure-landing-zone/">Azure Landing Zone series</a> is the first series.</p>
