  <h2>About the repository</h2>
  <p>The <a href="{{ site.repo }}">Azure Landing Zone repository</a> helps you learn how to build and run an Azure landing zone with Terraform. It covers the Cloud Adoption Framework design areas, Corp and Online archetypes, a policy model, labs and day-2 operations (running it after it is built).</p>
  <p>It is an independent learning repository. Its Terraform checks run in public GitHub Actions, and this <a href="{{ site.repo }}/blob/main/docs/03-implementation/release-evidence.md">page in the repository</a> says what those checks do and do not show.</p>
